{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2022-09-27 07:30:00', 'title': 'DARRELL BROWN NAMED ECOLAB PRESIDENT AND COO', 'text': "ST. PAUL, MINN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ECOLAB INC. ANNOUNCED THAT DARRELL R. BROWN, CURRENTLY EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND PRESIDENT, GLOBAL INDUSTRIAL, WILL BECOME PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER (COO) EFFECTIVE OCT. 1, 2022. “AS ECOLAB CONTINUES TO GROW AND EXPAND HOW WE DELIVER ON OUR PURPOSE TO PROTECT WHAT'S VITAL, THIS ENHANCEMENT TO OUR MANAGEMENT STRUCTURE WILL HELP US MAXIMIZE OUR FUTURE GROWTH OPPORTUNITIES AND IS A REFLECTION OF OUR STRONG LEADERSHIP TEAM,” SAID CHRISTOPHE BECK, ECO"}